computer.md — Third-party notices

This file lists third-party software included in or relied on by
the computer.md daemon, CLI, and tooling, with their licenses.

Apache-2.0 requires preservation of NOTICE files from upstream
dependencies; permissive licenses (MIT, BSD-2/3, ISC) require
attribution; LGPL requires runtime-linkage disclosure.

Regenerate this file by running:

    cd daemon && go install github.com/google/go-licenses && \
        go-licenses report ./... > /tmp/daemon-licenses.csv

then merging into this file. The manually-added section below
covers preinstalled-worker entries that `go-licenses` does not see.

