============================================================
Frontend dependencies (daemon/web)
============================================================

The per-machine UI under `daemon/web/` is a Vite + React + TypeScript
SPA embedded into the daemon binary via `//go:embed all:web/dist`.
Run `npm list --omit=dev --json --depth=0` in `daemon/web/` to see
the production dependency tree, or check `daemon/web/package.json`
for the headline packages. Common entries:

- React + React DOM                         MIT
- Vite                                      MIT
- TypeScript                                Apache-2.0
- Tailwind CSS                              MIT

============================================================
Preinstalled CLI workers (image-time, not Go deps)
============================================================

The daemon's installer (`daemon/bootstrap/install.sh`) installs
coding-agent CLIs the manager uses as workers. These run on the
customer's machine; they are not linked into the daemon binary.

- @anthropic-ai/claude-code (Claude Code CLI)
  https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code
  License: per upstream package — review at install time.

- @openai/codex (Codex CLI)
